+#### [Leon](https://github.com/leon-ai/leon)
+> **Description:** Leon is an open source personal assistant that can live on your own server and interact through voice or text, including offline-friendly usage. The README stresses its skill system, privacy focus, and extensibility rather than one fixed domain. Restaurants can adapt Leon for internal back-office helpers, manager copilots, voice-driven checklists, or smart displays in kitchen and office settings. It is not restaurant-specific, but it is one of the more mature assistant-style repos that remains easy to repurpose. Last commit: Nov 6, 2025. Stars: 16,813. Primary language: TypeScript. License: MIT.
+
