+#### [Mycroft Core](https://github.com/MycroftAI/mycroft-core)
+> **Description:** Mycroft Core is an archived but still influential open source voice assistant platform with a large skill ecosystem and clear voice-first architecture. The README explains voice commands, pairing, skill loading, and configurable services. While it is no longer actively maintained, it remains useful as a reference stack for restaurants experimenting with private kiosks, hands-free back-office commands, or embedded assistant hardware. Its age is a real tradeoff, but the Apache license and mature documentation still make it a viable base for prototyping. Last commit: Sep 8, 2024. Stars: 6,609. Primary language: Python. License: Apache-2.0.
