+#### [Rasa](https://github.com/RasaHQ/rasa)
+> **Description:** Rasa is an open source conversational AI framework for text and voice assistants with business logic, dialogue management, and custom actions. Its README emphasizes reliable, scalable AI agents that can handle real-world complexity instead of only free-form chat. That is especially relevant for restaurants where booking policies, delivery zones, order changes, and escalation rules matter. Rasa is one of the strongest choices when a restaurant operator needs deterministic workflows around reservations, support, or omnichannel messaging. Last commit: Dec 18, 2025. Stars: 20,961. Primary language: Python. License: Apache-2.0.
