+### Menu OCR and Document Understanding
+
+#### [PaddleOCR](https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)
+> **Description:** PaddleOCR presents itself as a powerful, lightweight OCR toolkit that turns PDFs and images into structured data for AI, with support for 100+ languages and deep document parsing features. The README highlights document understanding, Markdown and JSON output, table extraction, and information extraction components, which are valuable for restaurants digitizing menus, invoices, recipes, SOPs, or vendor paperwork. It is one of the most capable OSS document stacks in this space. GitHub shows major adoption and an Apache license. Last visible GitHub release: Nov 13, 2025. Stars: 66,500. Primary language: Python. License: Apache-2.0.
