+#### [EasyOCR](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR)
+> **Description:** EasyOCR is a ready-to-use OCR library covering 80+ languages and many major writing systems. The README keeps the pitch simple: install it, point it at an image, and extract text without building a full OCR pipeline from scratch. That simplicity is useful for restaurants that need quick menu extraction, signage analysis, receipt digitization, or low-friction OCR in prototypes. It is less specialized than document-heavy stacks like PaddleOCR, but the lower setup overhead makes it attractive for fast integration work. Last commit: Dec 5, 2025. Stars: 28,544. Primary language: Python. License: Apache-2.0.
