+> Best AI tools for restaurants in 2026 are still a niche in open source, so this list focuses on the strongest self-hosted GitHub projects restaurants can actually adapt for phone ordering, menu OCR, staff copilots, demand forecasting, and reservations. Every entry below is a public GitHub repository, and categories with thin restaurant-specific coverage are called out honestly as gaps.
