+## TL;DR
+- `tastyigniter/TastyIgniter` is the strongest restaurant-specific open source platform in this list for online ordering, reservations, and restaurant operations.
+- `pipecat-ai/pipecat`, `Intervo/Intervo`, and `RasaHQ/rasa` are the most practical foundations for AI phone ordering, reservations, and support agents.
+- `PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR`, `JaidedAI/EasyOCR`, and `tesseract-ocr/tesseract` are the best menu digitization and document OCR picks.
+- `langgenius/dify`, `FlowiseAI/Flowise`, `Mintplex-Labs/anything-llm`, and `open-webui/open-webui` are the easiest ways to ship self-hosted restaurant copilots and knowledge bots.
+- `Nixtla/neuralforecast`, `unit8co/darts`, and `sktime/pytorch-forecasting` are the strongest open source forecasting stacks for demand, staffing, and inventory planning.
