+## Why This List
+Restaurants need AI tools they can audit, self-host, and integrate with their own menus, POS data, reservation workflows, and support channels. The best AI tools for restaurants in 2026 are not mostly restaurant-only products on GitHub; the real open source opportunity is combining restaurant software with general-purpose voice AI, OCR, RAG, and forecasting projects that restaurants can run without proprietary SaaS lock-in.
